    "title": "School bus crash in Farmville - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Erin Jenkins Pel Law Abbie Sudbury Ryan Martinolich No media credit provided. ,\n6 hours ago PITT COUNTY, N.C. (WNCT) — A school bus was involved in an accident in Farmville.\nNo injuries reported among Pitt County Schools students or the driver. The students were all picked up by their parents and returned home.\nThe accident is still under investigation by law enforcement.\nWNCT was on the scene and will update as more information becomes available.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WNCT.\n4",
